  Copyright 2026 - Present IronCalc GmbH

IronCalc is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0, at your option, as is this
project (see LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE, copied from IronCalc).

Files carried over from IronCalc, at commit
9cfbdfce5efcdbedd57520ad9fd797b12e6bf0ba (2026-10-23, npm @ironcalc/workbook
and @ironcalc/wasm 0.9.1), all from webapp/IronCalc/ in that repository:

  src/lib/upstream/   files from webapp/IronCalc/src/, unchanged (one is an
                      excerpt); src/lib/upstream/UPSTREAM.md lists each file
                      with its upstream path
  static/fonts/       Inter font files and OFL.txt from webapp/IronCalc/fonts/
                      (Inter, Copyright 2020 The Inter Project Authors, SIL
                      Open Font License 1.1), used by the demo app only
  src/lib/components/icons/Fx.svelte
                      the SVG of webapp/IronCalc/src/icons/fx.svg

The Svelte components in src/lib/components/ are ports of the React
components of webapp/IronCalc/src/components/; each names the upstream file
it ports. docs/parity.md maps every upstream file to its counterpart.

The engine is not part of this repository: it is used as the npm packages
@ironcalc/wasm and (optionally) @ironcalc/wasm-xlsx, published by IronCalc
under MIT OR Apache-2.0.
